sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Ingress as Platform Ingress<br/>HTTPS TLS Termination
    participant OGX as OGX Server<br/>8321/TCP HTTP
    participant Auth as OAuth2/OIDC Issuer<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant vLLM as vLLM Inference<br/>HTTP Bearer Token
    participant vLLMEmb as vLLM Embedding<br/>HTTP Bearer Token
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP
    participant VecDB as Vector DB<br/>(Milvus/pgvector/Qdrant)
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Search as Web Search<br/>(Brave/Tavily)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MCP as MCP Server

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over Client,PG: Flow 1: Inference Request (Chat Completions)
        Client->>Ingress: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+
        Ingress->>OGX: HTTP/8321 (plaintext)<br/>TLS terminated at ingress
        OGX->>Auth: GET /.well-known/jwks.json<br/>HTTPS/443 (if AUTH_ISSUER set)
        Auth-->>OGX: JWKS keys
        OGX->>OGX: Validate JWT token
        OGX->>vLLM: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, Bearer token
        vLLM-->>OGX: Chat completion response<br/>(streaming or batch)
        OGX->>PG: INSERT inference log<br/>TCP/5432, Password auth
        PG-->>OGX: OK
        OGX-->>Ingress: JSON response
        Ingress-->>Client: HTTPS response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over Client,VecDB: Flow 2: RAG File Ingestion
        Client->>Ingress: POST /v1/files<br/>HTTPS, multipart upload
        Ingress->>OGX: HTTP/8321
        OGX->>OGX: Validate JWT (conditional)
        OGX->>S3: PUT object<br/>HTTPS/443, AWS IAM
        S3-->>OGX: Upload confirmed
        OGX->>OGX: Process file (Docling/pypdf)<br/>Local embedded models
        Client->>Ingress: POST /v1/vector_stores/{id}/files<br/>HTTPS
        Ingress->>OGX: HTTP/8321
        OGX->>vLLMEmb: POST /v1/embeddings<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, Bearer token
        vLLMEmb-->>OGX: Embedding vectors (dim=768)
        OGX->>VecDB: Insert vectors<br/>TCP, Token/Password/API key
        VecDB-->>OGX: Indexed
        OGX->>PG: INSERT file & vector store metadata<br/>TCP/5432
        PG-->>OGX: OK
        OGX-->>Ingress: Success response
        Ingress-->>Client: HTTPS response
    end

    rect rgb(245, 255, 230)
        Note over Client,MCP: Flow 3: Agent/Responses with Tool Use
        Client->>Ingress: POST /v1/responses<br/>HTTPS, with tools config
        Ingress->>OGX: HTTP/8321
        OGX->>OGX: Validate JWT (conditional)
        loop Agent reasoning loop
            OGX->>vLLM: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>with tool definitions
            vLLM-->>OGX: Response with tool_calls
            alt Web Search tool
                OGX->>Search: GET /search<br/>HTTPS/443, API key
                Search-->>OGX: Search results
            else File Search tool
                OGX->>OGX: Local vector search<br/>embedded models
            else MCP tool
                OGX->>MCP: Tool invocation<br/>varies
                MCP-->>OGX: Tool result
            end
        end
        OGX->>PG: INSERT agent state<br/>TCP/5432
        PG-->>OGX: OK
        OGX-->>Ingress: Final response (streaming)
        Ingress-->>Client: HTTPS response
    end
